alternatives: A thicker lip needs a deeper inset (cover below flush), thinner wings or less wing air, each a change to the accepted fit; the canonical wing lanes connect through two lower 69.3 by 4.96 mm cleanout mouths into the empty PCB room. Physical support-removal effort remains unqualified.
