click: x=47.786 y=49.529 z=319.335

[ceiling] Functional upper pump-flange bearings. Each flat underside establishes the pump's axial stop opposite its independent screw-fastened retainer. Local Tree Slim supports leave through the open loading well before the pump is installed. Physical support finish and removal remain unqualified.
alternatives: A corbel below the bearing occupies the flange's insertion envelope. Sloping or removing the bearing changes the axial seating datum and the opposed flange capture. These are local bearing strips, with direct access through the loading well while the front enclosure is loose.
