[ceiling] Functional heat-set insertion ceilings for the independent pump retainers. Each flat ceiling establishes perpendicular insertion into the continuous pilot surround. Local Tree Slim supports leave through the straight underside loading room before inserts and pumps are installed. Physical support finish and removal remain unqualified.
alternatives: Sloping the entry removes the perpendicular heat-set installation face. Local flat pads in a sloping ceiling add separate faces around the screw stations. Raising the ceiling changes the insert seat and screw engagement. The straight retainer rooms preserve one flat ceiling around the required pump loading wells.
